      "id": "2065609003451994143",
      "text": "Claude Fable 5 has only been released for a few days, but people have already built amazing projects with just the prompt:\n\n• Accurate physics simulation (Boeing 747 benchmark)\n\n• Giant gothic city sinks in the ocean with procedural shaders\n\n• Interactive app to feed goldfish\n\n• Real-scale Yosemite navigation using satellite data + NASA elevation\n\n• Fluid ink simulation, liquid glass UI, to realistic ragdoll physics\n\nThis shows how powerful multimodal reasoning + code generation is in Fable 5. Can build a 3D world, physics simulation, and complete applications in minutes.\n\n#ClaudeFable5 #AIBuilder",
      "author": {
        "id": "1579754929605861376",
        "name": "Tips Excel",
        "screenName": "gudanglifehack",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1591216099403567105/DiHCpCPq_normal.jpg",
