    {
      "id": "2065608017811534029",
      "text": "Wow, this thread is really cool! 🔥\n\nClaude Fable 5 is indeed gassing hard. From liquid glass UI pure CSS, large-scale 3D Yosemite using NASA data, to goldfish feeder app, Boeing 747 physics simulator, and ink fluid simulation — all made by ordinary people in a short time. This is a real proof that AI has become a superpower for creators & builders.\n\nThe most impressive thing for me: non-engineers can make full-stack apps, games, physics simulators, even emulators in just hours. This is not just a “cool demo”, this is the democratisation of making a new level of software.\n\nKeep cooking, Anthropic team! 👏\n\nAnd for all builders in this thread: you are so inspiring. Want to see you push Fable 5 (or Grok) to an even crazier limit.\n\nWhat are you building right now? Share here, we support together! 🚀\n\n#Fable5 #Claude #AICreators",
      "author": {
