      "id": "2065489705668637118",
      "text": "The latest Claude model is fundamentally shifting frontend development.\n\nSomeone just generated a complex glass liquid UI using strictly pure CSS.\n\nThe liquid refraction and lighting look like days of meticulous Figma work... wait until you see the actual generated code. https://t.co/noA7rO0Hx6",
