        "id": "2064993321265566175",
        "text": "How I build with Claude Fable 5\n\n1. Three.js = rotate and explore any product in 3D in the browser\n\n2. Color swatches = swap a material value to change the model live\n\n3. CSS radial-gradient = premium spotlight glow zero images\n\n4. GSAP ScrollTrigger = scroll turns one screen into a full story\n\n5. Monospace fonts = signal precision and luxury instantly\n\n6. AudioContext = ambient sound toggle in one call\n\nSave this",
        "author": {
          "screenName": "Oluwaphilemon1",
          "name": "FHILY👑"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "2065041022091247873",
      "text": "Fable 5 is insane at frontend implementation.\n\nOne website screenshot became a near pixel-perfect interactive 3D dashboard.\n\n3D globe, route arcs, glass UI, motion details, all rebuilt in one pass.\n\nFable 5 genuinely blew me away.✨",
