      "id": "2064998747940266132",
      "text": "It's been 40hrs since Claude Fable 5, a Mythos-class model has been out\n\nPeople all over the world has been tackling the hardest and weirdest tasks they had struggled with before\n\nHere's a list of N incredible things it can do\n> optimize tricky high-speed code to run 17 times faster\n> extremely realisting ink mixing simulation\n> 3D world rendering from real world data\n> perfectly designed interactive websites\n> complex physics simulations\n> ready-to-print 3D models\n> space objects trajectories simulation\n> smooth interactive liquid glass UI with CSS",
      "author": {
        "id": "1505281056076931073",
        "name": "DANNY 💢",
        "screenName": "dannytook",
        "profileImageUrl": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1924173535699755008/z6azJJu9_normal.jpg",
